      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carabanchel"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Madrid’s oldest building, the fully conserved Mudejar Hermitage of Santa María La Antigua, sits in Carabanchel.",
